# .claudeignore — patterns excluded from Claude Code's file indexing.
# Agent Collections ignore triad (DHI-529). Same path *classes* as
# .cursorignore / .opencodeignore; see docs/architecture/isolation-strategy.md §4 / §8.1.
# Future installer (5.x) should merge missing framework classes — never wipe consumer entries without opt-in.

# --- Agent Collections: secrets / build ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
coverage/
.env
.env.*
.env.local
*.secret
*.pem
*.key

# --- Agent Collections: other-tool packaging ---
# Cursor (own packaging for Cursor — exclude from Claude)
.cursor/
# OpenCode placeholder (DHI-525)
adapters/opencode/
opencode.json
opencode.jsonc
